<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Application for Approval of Prototype or Employer Sponsored Individual Retirement Account</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  td { padding: 4px 0; }
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">Form 5306</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">(Rev. March 1998)</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Department of the Treasury</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Internal Revenue Service</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">OMB No. 15-045-0390</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(Under Section 408(a), (b), or (c) of the Internal Revenue Code)</p>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part I Identifying Information (see instructions before completing this part)</h2>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">1 Approval requested for:</p>
    <p style="margin-left: 20px;">a type of individual retirement account—</p>
    <div style="margin-left: 40px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="prototype" name="prototype">
      <label for="prototype">Prototype under section 408(a) or 408(b)</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 40px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="employer" name="employer">
      <label for="employer">Prototype under section 408(c) established by employer or employee association</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 40px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="initial" name="initial">
      <label for="initial">Initial application</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">2 Amendment—Enter ►</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">3a Name of applicant</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
          <span data-field="applicant_name">{{ applicant_name }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">3b Employer identification number of applicant</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
          <span data-field="employer_id_number">{{ employer_id_number }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Number, street, and room or suite no. (if a P.O. box, see instructions on page 2.)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="applicant_address_line_1">{{ applicant_address_line_1 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">City or town, state, and ZIP code</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="applicant_city_state_zip">{{ applicant_city_state_zip }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">4a Name of person to contact</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="contact_person_name">{{ contact_person_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">4b Telephone number</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
        <span data-field="contact_phone_number">{{ contact_phone_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">5 Type of sponsoring organization (if you are applying for a ruling under section 408(c), do not complete this item):</p>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="company" name="company">
      <label for="company">Insurance company</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="regulated" name="regulated">
      <label for="regulated">Regulated investment company</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="trade" name="trade">
      <label for="trade">Trade or professional association</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="federally" name="federally">
      <label for="federally">Federally insured credit union</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="savings" name="savings">
      <label for="savings">Savings and loan association that qualifies as a bank</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="approved" name="approved">
      <label for="approved">Approved non-bank trustee (attach copy of approval letter)</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="bank" name="bank">
      <label for="bank">Bank</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">6 Name of trustee or custodian</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="trustee_custodian_name">{{ trustee_custodian_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Number, street, and room or suite no. (if a P.O. box, see instructions on page 2.)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="trustee_custodian_address_line_1">{{ trustee_custodian_address_line_1 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">City or town, state, and ZIP code</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="trustee_custodian_city_state_zip">{{ trustee_custodian_city_state_zip }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part II Plan Information</h2>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">7 Type of funding entity:</p>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="trust" name="trust">
      <label for="trust">Trust</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="custodial" name="custodial">
      <label for="custodial">Custodial account</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="annuity" name="annuity">
      <label for="annuity">Annuity contract number ►</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">8 Provision for the trust is created for the exclusive benefit of the participant or his or her beneficiaries, or that the annuity contract must be owned only by the annuitant.</p>
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">b Provision for type of allowable contributions (i.e., only cash except for rollovers) and maximum limitation</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">c Provision for prohibiting the investment of trust assets in collectibles, or a statement informing individuals that an investment in collectibles, except for investments in certain coins, will be treated as a taxable distribution</p>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">d Provision for prohibiting on investment in life insurance contracts.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">e Provision that sets forth the rules on reinvesting distributions commencing before death</p>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">f Provision that sets forth the rules on required distributions commencing after death</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I have examined this application, including accompanying statements, and to the best of my knowledge and belief, it is true, correct, and complete.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Signature of officer</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-top: 5px;">
        <span data-field="officer_signature">{{ officer_signature }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Date</p>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-top: 5px;">
        <span data-field="submission_date">{{ submission_date }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Title</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="officer_title">{{ officer_title }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p>For Paperwork Reduction Act Notice, see back of form.</p>
    <p>Cat. No. 11830C</p>
    <p>Form 5306 (Rev. 3-98)</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="text-align: left;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">8 (continued from page 1)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Page 2</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">g Provision for nonforfeitability of account</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_nonforfeitability">{{ provision_nonforfeitability }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">h Provision for nontransferability of contract.</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_nontransferability">{{ provision_nontransferability }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">i Provision for application of premium refund (other than refunds attributable to excess contributions) before the end of the calendar year following the year of the refund toward the payment of future premiums or the purchase of additional benefits</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_premium_refund">{{ provision_premium_refund }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">j Provision prohibiting commingling assets</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_commingling">{{ provision_commingling }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">k Provision that annuity contracts must have flexible premiums</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_flexible_premiums">{{ provision_flexible_premiums }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">l Provision for separate accounting for the interest of each employee or member of the association.</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_separate_accounting">{{ provision_separate_accounting }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">m Provision for requirements of annual calendar year reports by trustees or issuers.</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_annual_reports">{{ provision_annual_reports }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">n Provision requiring substitution of non-bank trustee or custodian when notified by the Internal Revenue Service.</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_substitution">{{ provision_substitution }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">o Provision for type of includible compensation (e.g., wages, salaries, professional fees, etc.)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px;">
      <span data-field="provision_includible_compensation">{{ provision_includible_compensation }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">9 Disclosure statement (check either a or b):</p>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="a" name="disclosure_a">
      <label for="a">A attached is a copy of the disclosure statement that will be used to inform participants of the restrictions and limitations imposed by law on individual retirement programs such as eligibility for deductions, excise tax on excess contributions, penalties taxes on premature distributions, the consequences of prohibited transactions and other required topics;</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="b" name="disclosure_b">
      <label for="b">Each participant will be furnished a copy of Pub. 590, Individual Retirement Arrangements (IRAs). Do not submit a copy of Pub. 590 with this application.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">General Information</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Section references are to the Internal Revenue Code.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Purpose of Form—Sponsoring organization, employers, or employee associations, use Form 5306 to request an approval.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Whether a prototype trust or custodial account agreement meets the requirements of section 408(a) or 408(c); or</p>
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Whether a specific prototype individual retirement account meets the requirements of section 408(a) or 408(c).</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Paperwork Reduction Act Notice</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">We ask for the information on this form to carry out the Internal Revenue Service's mission. The Internal Revenue Service may use the information you provide to process your application for approval of a prototype or employer sponsored individual retirement account.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You are not required to provide the information requested on this form to submit your application to the Paperwork Reduction Act notice. The Internal Revenue Service will not use the information you provide for any other purpose.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Specific Instructions</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Use Form 5306 to request an approval for a prototype or employer sponsored individual retirement account.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you have questions concerning the accuracy of these time estimates or suggestions for making this form simpler, please contact the IRS office listed on the form to this addressed. See Where to File on this page.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>